kuraṇṭa(ka) (see also the additions on p. 460)
(1) Barleria prionitis Linn. (Kai.Nigh., oṣadhivarga 1049b; Nadk. 1,
nr. 312A; V. 2, p. 20; WIRM 1, p. 158; DGV 5, p. 293-295; KB 3, p. 1877-1879;
DWH 3, p. 43-44);
(2) Celosia argentea Linn. (Bt.; CD, p. 84).

kurabaka = kuravaka = kurubaka (see also the additions on pp. 460f.)
(1) Barleria cristata Linn. (Kai.Nigh., oṣadhivarga 1049a; KB 3, p.
1879-1880);
(2) Rhododendron species (Bt.);
(3) Lawsonia inermis Linn. = L. alba Lamk. (Nadk. 1, nr. 1448).
